["desc"] = "\nVersion 20250924\nNOTE: Anchor WeakAuras don’t actually show anything. Think of them like invisible “placeholders” you drag around your screen once to set where you want things to appear. From then on, every future QUI update or WA will snap to those anchors automatically. That means when I add or update WAs, you won’t ever need to reposition them again—they’ll always show up exactly where you set your anchors.",
